      "content": "Using the current network average as the baseline for a manual comparison is a simplified approach, but I can run that initial projection for you. I will simulate the performance impact based on industry averages for human-operated DAC systems, which often show variability and slower reaction times compared to automated systems. Be aware that this simulation will highlight a potential efficiency degradation, which you can then use to frame the discussion about cost versus performance.",
